{"id":"8747011468390705","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-value-gap.md","title":"真值间隙","display":"df-truth-value-gap — 真值间隙","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-value-gap","aliases":["91-df-truth-value-gap","91-df-gap"],"display":"df-truth-value-gap — 真值间隙","depends_on":["[[91-df-three-valued-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-value-gap"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-value-gap</span><span>91-df-gap</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-value-gap — 真值间隙"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2a6ae68f45ba9960\" href=\"?note=2a6ae68f45ba9960\" title=\"91-df-three-valued-satisfaction\">91-df-three-valued-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-value-gap-—-真值间隙-$\\mathrm{Gap}$\">df-truth-value-gap — 真值间隙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gap}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gap}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> (扩展语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)\">\\((\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)\\)</span> (三值模型, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2a6ae68f45ba9960\" href=\"?note=2a6ae68f45ba9960\" title=\"91-df-three-valued-satisfaction\">91-df-three-valued-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3:\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3:\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> (强 Kleene 三值评估)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}value\\text{-}gap}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}value\\text{-}gap}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在强 Kleene 语义中等价地，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}\n\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)\\not\\vDash_3\\varphi\\land\n(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)\\not\\vDash_3\\neg\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}\n\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)\\not\\vDash_3\\varphi\\land\n(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)\\not\\vDash_3\\neg\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}\\)</span>：相对于给定三值模型的真值间隙</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_3(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_3(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 既未被判真也未被判假</li>\n</ul>\n<p>真值间隙的含义：\n真值间隙是指既不真也不假的句子集合。这些句子在三值语义下取值&quot;未定义&quot;（undefined）。</p>\n<p>真值间隙的特征：\n间隙是语义和模型相对的概念，不能在未指定模型或理论的情况下由对象语言公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T\\varphi\\land\\neg T\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg T\\varphi\\land\\neg T\\neg\\varphi\\)</span> 直接定义。</p>\n<p>典型间隙句子：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>说谎者句子</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>使得<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\lambda \\urcorner)\">\\(\\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\lambda \\urcorner)\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>加强说谎者</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^*\">\\(\\lambda^*\\)</span>使得<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^* \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\lambda^* \\urcorner)\">\\(\\lambda^* \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\lambda^* \\urcorner)\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>自指悖论句子</strong>：各种涉及真理谓词的自指结构</li>\n</ul>\n<p>真值间隙与真理理论：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论</th>\n<th>间隙处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>TB/UTB</td>\n<td>经典对象理论本身不以三值模型表达间隙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td>其预期固定点模型允许间隙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VF</td>\n<td>可借助超赋值式预期语义表达间隙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>采用经典对象逻辑，但这不等于给出二值语义解</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>间隙的理论意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>间隙是解决悖论的关键机制</li>\n<li>三值逻辑通过间隙避免矛盾</li>\n<li>区分对象理论的经典推理与其非经典预期语义</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-value-gap-—-真值间隙-$\\mathrm{Gap}$","text":"df-truth-value-gap — 真值间隙 $\\mathrm{Gap}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-three-valued-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"2a6ae68f45ba9960","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-three-valued-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-three-valued-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"2a6ae68f45ba9960","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)$ (三值模型, see [[91-df-three-valued-satisfaction]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Gap}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3:\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}value\\text{-}gap}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}\n\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)\\not\\vDash_3\\varphi\\land\n(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)\\not\\vDash_3\\neg\\varphi.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Gap}_{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_3(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T\\varphi\\land\\neg T\\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\lambda \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^* \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\lambda^* \\urcorner)","display":false}],"bytes":2327,"backlinks":[{"id":"e9bbbe4420f54ce9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3f012d0f8371bf9a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0471e9434da6820e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b0e2f74fa0a4326a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"80b21a90a0262f70","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-gap]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","an